 "summary": "JDHA DOAS units with the D19 space temperature control program expose 77 objects through the optional BACnet MS/TP card: discharge air setpoints for space and neutral modes, air temperatures and humidities, damper, fan, compressor and heat outputs, building and duct pressures, CO2, unit enable, mode flags and alarms.",
